  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: 'KEEP YOUR HEADLIGHTS ON. TRUST YOUR EYES, NOT EVERY SIGN.


    An ordinary
    overnight shift: collect deliveries, service pumps, repair the breaker, answer
    the CB and restart the generator. Stop beside a marked station and HOLD ACTION
    to complete real work. Tasks unlock the final extraction. The stop changes as
    your shift progresses. Restored power repels the visitor. Complete every task
    to finish the night. For the delivery, exit the cab beside your colored parcel
    and hold ACTION to pick it up. Carry it to your matching shelf and hold ACTION
    to set it down; supplies count only after resting on that shelf.


    Movement
    uses your assigned driving controls. ACTION braces a tipped cursed load using
    physical restoring torque; otherwise ACTION away from a station toggles headlights.
    Each human keeps an independent truck and camera. Cooperative variants share
    objectives and never award individual winner points. Eliminated participants
    spectate surviving trucks. Rematch restores the whole venue, cargo and encounters.
    Default match: four minutes.'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
